ng and by including more information from online reviews as input features of our model we can get a reasonably well\u00a0estimate of the average unbiased ratings. We propose and compare several predictive models to estimate unbiased average ratings and show how textual data can play a critical role in enhancing the predictive power. Our results can help review aggregation platforms to determine mechanisms to cut down the bias on their platforms and can benefit businesses and consumers on their platform to access a fairer metric for service quality.","topics":[],"score":222752,"global_rank":176488},{"name":"xiaomuliu/AB_testing_techinques","owner":"xiaomuliu","html_url":"https://github.com/xiaomuliu/AB_testing_techinques","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":222752,"global_rank":176499},{"name":"calvintirrell/Loan_Analysis","owner":"calvintirrell","html_url":"https://github.com/calvintirrell/Loan_Analysis","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Our team utilized a limited data set of loan applications and compared 2 models to see which would predict approvals and denials more accurately","topics":[],"score":222752,"global_rank":176503},{"name":"calvintirrell/smartphone_price_classification","owner":"calvintirrell","html_url":"https://github.com/calvintirrell/smartphone_price_classification","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":"Determine a new smartphone's price based on similar specifications to current phone models.","topics":[],"score":222752,"global_rank":176504},{"name":"laurinalastella/Group7Weather","owner":"laurinalastella","html_url":"https://github.com/laurinalastella/Group7Weather","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Jupyter Notebook","description":null,"topics":[],"score":222752,"global_rank":176505},{"name":"jerome9189/shors-algorithm","owner":"jerome9189","ht